  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "OCFBench",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for OCFBench\n\t\n\n[Paper]\n[Code]\n[Website]\n\n\nThe OCFBench dataset is curated in the paper Occ4cast: LiDAR-based 4D Occupancy Completion and Forecasting.\nThe dataset is processed from public autonomous driving data to support the training and evaluation of the novel occupancy completion and forecasting (OCF) task.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tUses\n\t\n\nPlease download each .sqf file from individual directories and mount them to local system for usage.\nFor larger files that are splited into\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai4ce/OCFBench.",
